    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Campbells Auctioneers are delighted to present this three-bedroom property at Money Beg, Dunlewey, Co. Donegal to the open market.\n\nSituated in the heart of the spectacular Dunlewey area, the property occupies a peaceful rural setting surrounded by the dramatic landscape for which this part of West Donegal is renowned.\n\nThe accommodation is arranged over two floors. The Ground Floor comprises an Entrance Hall, Living Room, Kitchen, Bathroom, and Bedroom, while the First Floor contains a further Two Bedrooms.\n\nThe property is located in the heart of Dunlewey with the surrounding area offering an abundance of lakes, walking trails and spectacular mountain scenery. Mount Errigal and the Derryveagh Mountains are among the many well-known natural attractions found nearby.\n\nThe wider Gweedore area is also within easy driving distance, providing access to a range of shops, schools, restaurants and everyday amenities.\n\nWith its peaceful setting in one of Donegal`s most scenic areas, the property would lend itself well as either a Permanent Residence or Holiday Home.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and by strict appointment with Campbells Auctioneers.\n\n\nRef: K1293\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 2.26m (7'5\") x 1.35m (4'5\")\nTiled\n\nLiving Room - 6.46m (21'2\") x 3.58m (11'9\")\nLaminate Wooden Floor, Open Fire Place\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.43m (11'3\") x 3.26m (10'8\")\nCarpeted, Fitted Wardrobe\n\nKitchen - 2.87m (9'5\") x 1.92m (6'4\")\nTiled, Fitted Units, Backdoor\n\nBathroom - 2.26m (7'5\") x 1.82m (6'0\")\nTiled, Bath, Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.59m (11'9\") x 3.22m (10'7\")\nCarpeted\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.88m (12'9\") x 3.22m (10'7\")\nCarpeted\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
